Z||000010||LZeitgeist||07-23-2001||08:45 AM||||My original '88 4-cyl Coupe (now my Dad's) currently has 255,000 miles on it, with the original engine, and the engine has never had *any* internal work done during the life of the car. we've replaced the clutch/alternator/belts/oil/filters/sparkplugs/normal maintenance items, but not even the valve cover has ever been removed, much less anything else more 'intrusive' to the engine.<P>Oh, and it's still drivable, and it's still reliable. (Again, knock on wood...)||||reg||1
